<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Alerta: reporte de robo</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#fef2f2;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#fef2f2;padding:24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);">
        <tr>
          <td style="background-color:#9f1239;padding:24px 32px;">
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
              <tr>
                <td style="color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">solidAPP</td>
                <td align="right" style="color:#fecdd3;font-size:13px;">🚨 Reporte de robo</td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:32px;">
            <h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#9f1239;">
              Incidencia crítica — Reporte de robo
            </h1>
            <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#334155;">
              Se ha reportado un incidente de tipo <strong>{{ reason }}</strong> en la
              sucursal <strong>{{ parking_name }}</strong>. El operador
              <strong>{{ reported_by }}</strong> requiere atención inmediata.
            </p>
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:20px 0;border:1px solid #fecdd3;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#881337;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-weight:600;">Severidad</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;">
                  <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9f1239;color:#ffffff;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:9999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;">⚠⚠ {{ severity|upper }}</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#881337;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-weight:600;">Tipo</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;">robery_reported</td>
              </tr>
              {% if plate %}
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#881337;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-weight:600;">Matrícula</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;font-family:monospace;font-weight:700;">{{ plate }}</td>
              </tr>
              {% endif %}
              {% if parking_space_label %}
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#881337;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-weight:600;">Plaza</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;">{{ parking_space_label }}</td>
              </tr>
              {% endif %}
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#881337;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-weight:600;">Hora reporte</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;">{{ detected_at }}</td>
              </tr>
              {% if photos %}
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#881337;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-weight:600;">Fotos adjuntas</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;">
                  {% for p in photos %}<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;">{{ p }}</code> {% endfor %}
                </td>
              </tr>
              {% endif %}
              {% if notes %}
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#881337;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-weight:600;">Notas</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;">{{ notes }}</td>
              </tr>
              {% endif %}
            </table>
            <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#334155;">
              Acción inmediata: revisar el panel de alertas, verificar las
              cámaras de la sucursal y, si procede, avisar a las autoridades.
            </p>
            <p style="margin:20px 0 0 0;">
              <a href="{{ dashboard_url }}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9f1239;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;">
                Reconocer alerta
              </a>
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="background-color:#fff1f2;padding:16px 32px;border-top:1px solid #fecdd3;">
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#881337;">
              Alerta crítica generada automáticamente por el sistema de
              monitorización de solidAPP. ID interno: #{{ alert_id }}.
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>